title: "H2O Memory: TopoPhase Reference Prototype"
abstract: >-
  A minimum falsifiable reference implementation for an AI memory architecture
  hypothesis that separates epistemic formation from storage placement while
  preserving identity, provenance, temporal validity, correction, deletion,
  consent, uncertainty, and traceability.
